# Line endings. The repository stores LF and every checkout keeps LF, whatever core.autocrlf says, so the
# byte-level checks (tools/resonance/manifest.json, the generated catalog, sounds.json, lang) see the same bytes on
# every machine. Windows batch and PowerShell files keep CRLF (cmd.exe mishandles labels in LF-only batch files).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: never converted, never diffed as text
*.ogg binary
*.png binary
*.npz binary
*.jar binary
*.nbt binary
*.wav binary
*.zip binary
